# Local storage

- **Location**: All localStorage access goes through helpers in `src/lib/storage/`. Do not call `localStorage` directly from app or agent code.
- **Client-side only**: Storage helpers run in the browser only (e.g. in components or client-side agent code). Do not use in server components or during SSR without guards.
- **Typed keys**: Use a single key prefix for the app and typed get/set so keys stay consistent and values are parsed/serialized in one place.
- **No secrets**: Do not store secrets or tokens in localStorage; it is not secure.
